MEFinder MCP sidecar onefile extraction marker.

This file ships inside every MEFinderMCP.exe PyInstaller bundle and is
extracted into the program's _MEI temp directory at startup. The presence of
this exact filename identifies a _MEI directory as belonging to MEFinder, so
the self-cleanup in src/me_finder/onefile_cleanup.py only ever deletes MEFinder
extraction directories, never another application's. Do not rename this file
without updating ONEFILE_MARKER_NAME.
